### DHCP configuration

Get-NetIPInterface -AddressFamily IPv4 |
    Select-Object InterfaceAlias, Dhcp


### IP / DHCP lease configuration

Get-NetIPConfiguration

ipconfig /all


### DNS configuration

Get-DnsClientServerAddress |
    Where-Object AddressFamily -eq 2


### Domain DNS resolution

Resolve-DnsName engineering.local


### Domain Controller resolution

Resolve-DnsName DC01.engineering.local


### LDAP SRV discovery

Resolve-DnsName `
    _ldap._tcp.dc._msdcs.engineering.local `
    -Type SRV


### Domain Controller discovery

nltest /dsgetdc:engineering.local


### DNS connectivity

Test-NetConnection 192.168.100.20 -Port 53


### LDAP connectivity

Test-NetConnection 192.168.100.20 -Port 389


### SMB connectivity

Test-NetConnection 192.168.100.20 -Port 445


### SYSVOL

dir \\DC01\SYSVOL


### NETLOGON

dir \\DC01\NETLOGON
